{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_ccheal_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ccheal_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "学医之路",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ccheal_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3c289b26ebf4597dd90032751985b7a43632b8ff1c7c4b79c86433d77bd92cc1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢谢你，嘉维尔医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我感觉自己好点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我能做的也只有这么多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没事，反正矿石病也治不好，能多活一会儿是一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我初来乍到，想知道这座城里有对矿石病有研究的医生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这样的，几个月前，有个萨卡兹医生来了这里，买下了西边的一片废墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后，她放出消息，说她有能够治疗矿石病的特制糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要愿意让她抽一管血，她就会把糖果给患者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......有人相信这种话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "本来是没有的，但是有人病急乱投医，把孩子送过去之后，孩子的症状真的好转了，于是，逐渐开始有越来越多的人相信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "本来，事情到这里也就结束了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，最近贫民窟里有传闻，好像有个孩子失踪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "失踪......你们猜是那个医生干的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "最后一个看到那个孩子的人说，她去了那个医生那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么不去找那个医生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我们不敢。据去过那里的人说，那个医生的房间里到处是血袋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且她的态度也很凶恶，看起来像是随时都有可能暴起杀人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么不告诉王酋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......因为失踪的只是个无家可归的孩子，老爷们根本不愿意管这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然这样，我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你真的要去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我要去看看，那个医生是不是真的有治疗矿石病的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果是假的，而且是那个人绑架了孩子，我一定会让她受到惩罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房间十分破败，刚踏入的时候，嘉维尔甚至怀疑自己来错了地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不对，有一股味道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "血的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她刚迈开脚步，就好像踢到了什么东西。\n她低头看去——\n那是一只鞋子，从尺寸来看，毫无疑问，是孩子的。\n而鞋子的旁边，有一摊血迹。\n她顿时感到毛骨悚然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这里，究竟发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她蹲下身，仔细嗅了嗅血迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是货真价实的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道说，真的有一个孩子死在这里了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她马上注意到，血迹的旁边，有一颗糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这就是那个医生发给孩子们的糖果吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这......根本就是普通的糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "用这些糖果欺骗孩子们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉维尔抬头看去，一个女孩，正站在二楼的楼梯口，怔怔地看着她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小朋友，能不能告诉我，这里发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到底是怎么回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你怎么又回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小朋友，别怕，我是来救你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......你就是这里的医生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉维尔来不及为房间中挂着的血袋感到吃惊，因为，在她面前的，是一个白发红瞳的萨卡兹。\n她猛然想起自己在通识书上读到过的内容——血魔。\n他们是萨卡兹的分支，十分强大，但也臭名昭著。\n他们行走于阴影之中，以他人的血液为食，杀人如麻，无恶不作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是......血魔？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来如此，你用糖果诱骗城里的孩子，就是为了把他们变成你的食物对吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你又是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫嘉维尔，是个医生，我今天就是来揭穿你的邪恶阴谋的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我现在没空对付你，先睡一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......你对我......做了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "调整了一下你的血液循环而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "乖乖睡一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......我感觉我的身体好像在燃烧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？中了我的源石技艺居然没有马上倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我说过了......我叫......嘉维尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......是个医生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我来救这个孩子——嗬啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "居然挣脱了，这真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这真是越来越有意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么获得她的血好呢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放开那个孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈......那就这么办吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只见血魔将手拂过女孩的头顶，女孩立刻失去知觉，缓缓倒在血魔的脚边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你对那个孩子做了什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她将作为我的粮食被保存在这里，放心吧，她不会感到痛苦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你、你这混蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你想救她的话，那就和她交换吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "交换？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没错，你来代替她接受抽血，这样，我就放过她，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦？这么爽快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是在这里和你大打出手，我怕伤到那个孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你要说话算话，放她离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......否则，就算我今天死在这里，我也绝不会放过你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要如何不放过我？你马上就要死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "部族里的祭司爷爷说过，阿卡胡拉的勇士死后，灵魂会回归阿卡胡拉的湖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“我的灵魂经过湖水的洗涤，会融入林间的风，会化作天上的雨。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "该害怕的是你，可恶的血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当风刮过你的脸庞，当雨水淋在你的肩头时，你就会想起我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "萨尔贡的部族之间真是有不少有趣的传承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可惜，你不了解血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "风在我的身边会被血腥的味道驱散，而雨在我的头顶也会化作血液融入我的身体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的灵魂，伤不了我一丝一毫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉维尔愤怒地闭上了眼，准备迎接自己的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "还没离开雨林时，嘉维尔一直以为，最刺眼的东西，是太阳。\n有一次，她鼓起勇气想要直视太阳，结果眼睛被晒伤，好几天看东西都带着重影。\n应该没有比太阳更刺眼的东西了，她想。\n但是，离开雨林后，她发现自己错了。\n最刺眼的东西，其实是其他人的目光......是其他人看向她身上源石结晶的目光。\n她不害怕这些目光中蕴含的恶意，但是，每当她想要直视这些目光时，目光的主人就会别开视线。\n她花了一段时间才明白，原来，自己得的病不叫“石头病”而叫“矿石病”；原来，自己这样的人被叫作“感染者”。\n原来，矿石病被认为是不治之症。\n原来，感染者的生活大多很糟糕。\n在雨林里，明明没有这样的区别，大家也不会歧视得了矿石病的人。\n她想不清楚为什么，她只知道，即使是不治之症，如果能让矿石病人好过一点，或许就能让他们的处境好一些。\n于是她四处寻找，寻找那些自称有办法对付矿石病的医生，想要从他们身上寻求方法。\n但每一次的寻求，最终带给她的都是失望。\n他们有的只是沽名钓誉，有的更是借着治疗感染者的名义做着违法的勾当。\n而她明明只是指出了这一点，反而被他们诬陷，一度成为通缉犯。\n为什么呢？\n............\n她感到针管插入手臂带来的些微疼痛，随之而来的，是血液被抽离的丧失感。\n哦对了，阿卡胡拉的伙伴们还不知道她的身上发生了什么呢。\n早知道，应该先回去看她们一眼的。\n丧失感很快就结束了。\n然后是一片沉寂。\n这就是死亡吗？\n血魔杀人的方法原来是无痛的吗......\n..................\n............\n......\n不对，她并没有死？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......虽然你血液中的源石结晶密度不低，但是你的血液状态很健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "果然，你的身体素质远超常人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不杀我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我为什么要杀你？我说的是，让你代替她接受抽血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你不是，血魔......抽血不就是......杀人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的同族确实有不少人喜欢这么干，但我没这个兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你为什么要这么做？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你刚才靠意志力挣脱了我的源石技艺，我对你的血很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，要和你战斗估计很麻烦，所以临时想了这个办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪恶的血魔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢谢你的配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫华法琳，是个医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小朋友，醒醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大姐姐，你也是来治病的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是来找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外面的人都以为你失踪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "医生告诉我，我太虚弱了，让我先静养，我就没有出门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以你真的没有骗人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有些人连血魔可以成为医生都不相信，你无法说服这样的人去相信超出他们想象的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......你不去澄清吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在几百年前就已经不关心其他人的看法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有时间做这种事，我情愿多做一些血液研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "医生，谢谢你，我感觉好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你给我血，我给你药，各取所需而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们该回去了，别打扰我进行研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，医生再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，那些糖果——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那确实是普通的糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，只要患者相信它有效果，它就会有效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在医学上，这叫作“安慰剂”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，这不是等同于欺骗吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你能给出特效药吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "矿石病是不治之症，如果欺骗能让患者多活一段时间，我找不到不这么做的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "治疗的目的是减轻病人的痛苦，只要能够达成治疗目的，别说欺骗了，就是成为恶魔又怎么样呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼，我也不指望你能够理解我的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你走吧，别再来打扰我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来如此，太有道理了，医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，这不是很有道理吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道说你还在骗我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我说的都是真的。只是相信的人不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么？我觉得你说得对啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "医生又不是超人，就算是被记恨，只要能治好病人我就心满意足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......没想到，你居然是一个明白人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "华法琳医生，不，华法琳大师，我一直在寻找你这样的，能教授我真正的医术的医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可以传授我医术吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难得遇到一个你这样懂我的人，我也不是不能够教你一些医术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，我又不想让人打扰我的血液研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不是对我的血液感兴趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我可以让你抽血！你随便研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这倒是不用，刚才抽的那管血已经够用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你有什么需要解决的麻烦，我可以帮你解决！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这么说来......倒还真有一件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "样本不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "用糖果换抽血，信的人终归是少数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还有许多感染者并不相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "加上你刚才说有关我的谣言已经传开了，恐怕接下来更不会有人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在你来之前，我正盘算着公开自己的身份，恐吓这里的居民，好让我挨个抽血呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你觉得这个方法不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，我感觉有点太慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就算加上我有两个人，要抽那么多人的血也不轻松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你说得也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......有了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这件事交给我吧，大师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果我能解决的话，你愿意传授我医术吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘉维尔怎么一去好几天都没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道她遇到了什么麻烦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就算她没有解决这个问题，我也打算教她医术的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要不然，还是去找她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "华法琳大师！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你怎么才回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这些血袋是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这样的，我平时会在贫民窟义诊，那里的人都愿意听我说两句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我告诉他们，你的研究需要一些血液，他们知道后，都愿意在力所能及的范围内献血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，对了，你可以放心，关于你的传闻，我也对他们澄清过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样，这些应该够你研究了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "按照你给我当参考的样本，我也已经做好了相应的记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是记录册，你可以看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗯，你记录得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你愿意传授我医术了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没想到，我居然会在这里遇到你这样一个意气相投，又能做到我做不到的事的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我要是早点遇到你，还担心什么缺少样本！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，交给我就对了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘉维尔，我决定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "从今往后，我们可以一起旅行，去研究各地感染者的血液状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到时候，就由你来帮我收集血液，而我来研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也会把我知道的医术都传授给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要去哪里，华法琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什——凯尔希？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是怎么找到这里来的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我本来就已经锁定了你潜伏在这一带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "结果，听说这里有一个医生，在替人治病的时候，会帮忙宣传另一名血魔医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "得来全不费工夫，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......可恶，忘了你这家伙的消息灵通得不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你已经离开岗位三个月了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我每个月都有给你寄研究成果过去，也不算是离开岗位吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有些事必须要有你在场才能推进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你该回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凯尔希，是华法琳的同事，我是来带她回去的。你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫嘉维尔，是个医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "华法琳说，如果我帮她的忙，她就愿意传授我医术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要带走她吗？可是，我们刚要启程——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没错！我刚要和嘉维尔开始旅行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "答应你的血库已经开始建造了，你不是说要亲自监督吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你早点告诉我，我早就回去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嘉维尔，看来我们的旅行要暂时搁置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你们说的罗德岛是个什么样的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罗德岛是一家致力于矿石病治疗的制药公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那里面是不是有很多像华法琳一样，可以教我医术的人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然华法琳要回去，那我可以跟你们一起去吗，我也想加入罗德岛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这倒是个办法。凯尔希，我向你保证，她是个不可多得的人才！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些血袋都是你收集的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这份记录册......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "华法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你什么时候拿过去的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，十分详实的数据，笔记和总结也都十分到位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然能否加入罗德岛还需要经过测试，但是光凭这份记录，你已经至少可以为自己赢得一份文职的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我想学医！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要你来到罗德岛，这样的机会数不胜数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过，在那之前，我有一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你为什么想要加入罗德岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那当然是因为，我想要治好所有人的矿石病！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，罗德岛欢迎你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
